547	## Step 3. Look up the ticket before creating it; never drop on 429
548	
549	**Why:** the in-memory dedup fails across 2 pods and restarts, a chat failure re-created the ticket, and a 429 dropped the finding for good. Now the relay asks the ticket API (`GET /tickets?external_ref=`) first, retries 429s after a delay, and paces itself with `TICKETS_RPS`.
