## Step 8. Support contract v2 behind CONTRACT_VERSION

**Why:** from 2 Nov every finding arrives twice (v1 and v2). The relay tickets one version and acks the other. v2 has a different fingerprint, so `legacy_fingerprint`, which we ask Priya for, links it back to the v1 ticket.

