- `go vet`, `go test -race ./...`: pass. New tests cover lookup-before-create,
  a second instance, chat failure, failure after create, 429, bad `line`,
  masking, replay token/`since`/retention, and v1/v2 gating and legacy matching.
- End to end against a real `nats-server` 2.10, the mock ticket API and the
  chat sink. Run: 300 samples, 2 relays, ticket API 503 on every 10th create
  (after creating), chat 500 on every 15th post.
  - Before: 27 of 243 fingerprints ticketed, 264 dropped on 429, 3 duplicates.
  - After: 243 of 243, 0 duplicates, 0 429s.
  - Replay since 1 March: 0 new tickets, 0 repeated chat posts, warning returned.
- v2 preview: on contract 1, 0 tickets from v2. On switch to 2: 20 new tickets
